6
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:26,356
The notes stay on this device. Qwen runs
through local Ollama and finds

7
00:00:26,358 --> 00:00:30,619
three possible commitments: a field report,
cleaned survey figures, and a

8
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:32,470
